    "body": "For Bricks of kind value, that only encapsulate an input widget, we can maximize the slot area of the input widget by reducing the padding as there are no inset notches to account for.\n\nTo enable this, add an additional config flag to the path generation utility in `path2.ts` which shrinks the padding and maximizing the main widget slot area.\n\n**More details TBD. Do not work on this until marked ready.**",
